Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,MAIN
Comment: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,(一方通行,Accelerator)
Comment: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,曾是學園都市僅有7位(超能力者,Level5)之首
Comment: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,曾經參加過(絕對能力者,Level 6)進化計劃
Comment: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是(警備員,Anti-Skill) 想見一下這間醫院的負責人
Comment: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,能拒絕(警備員,Anti-Skill)的要求
Comment: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,被盜的秘密武器看來是專門對付(一方通行,Accelerator)的
Comment: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 (一方通行,Accelerator)君
Comment: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,打擾一下 能不能幫我叫一下(一方通行,Accelerator)君呀
Comment: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 (一方通行,Accelerator)君在哪呢
Comment: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎 你就是(一方通行,Accelerator)君吧
Comment: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在拿著的那是 (第一位,Accelerator)那危險的基因數據
Comment: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你住手吧 我可不是那個嘴炮(無能力者,Level 0)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,……{防止内封bug}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:52.08,OPJP,,0,0,0,,真っ暗な街の　表面（うわべ）を飾った
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:56.00,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}無数の窓明かり
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:22:02.55,OPJP,,0,0,0,,蒼白い首に　重い鎖巻いて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.55,0:22:06.81,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}そのすべて嘲笑（わら）った
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:23.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,,この運命（さだめ）を背負って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:27.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,,血染まった　記憶の数だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:32.29,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}突き刺さった　黒い影を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.29,0:22:37.29,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}すべて壊して　真っ黒なこの手で
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:36.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:52.08,OPCN,,0,0,0,,漆黑昏暗的街道 無數明亮窗戶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:56.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}都是被裝飾過的外表
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:22:02.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,,沉重的枷鎖 纏繞在蒼白的頸上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.55,0:22:06.81,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}嘲笑著世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:10.14,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:12.85,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[When it's inside of my hand]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:15.61,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}[Everything reflects the darkness]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:19.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}Shadow is the light!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:23.24,OPCN,,0,0,0,,背負起這份命運
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:27.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,是一次次染上鮮血的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:32.29,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}那突然襲來的黑暗身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.29,0:22:37.29,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}用這漆黑的雙手 粉碎殆盡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:38.46,OPCN,,0,0,0,,I'll never change!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:40.88,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[When it's inside of my hand]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.43,0:22:46.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:48.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}[Everything reflects the darkness]
